{"study_accession":"PRJNA869559","secondary_study_accession":"SRP392168","title":"ALKBH8 suppresses oxidative stress and ameliorates inflammation via blocking NFκB/NLRP3 axis in Sepsis","description":"The molecular mechanisms underlying sepsis pathogenesis and its regulation are incompletely understood. Here we demonstrated that human AlkB homologue, ALKBH8, plays a critical role in sepsis. we demonstrated that inhibition of Reactive oxygen species (ROS) production by using N-acetylcysteine (NAC) antagonized the effect of ALKBH8 knockdown on inflammation response and NFκB/NLRP3 signaling activation in THP-1 cells. Overall design: A total of 10 patients with acute sepsis and 10 health donors were recruited to take the next-generation RNA-seq analysis and total RNA was purified from blood samples from sepsis patients (n = 5) and healthy control subjects (n = 5).","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":10,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN30310196","study_accession":"PRJNA869559","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"SEP_5","description":"SEP_5","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM6456152","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-08-19","attributes":[["source_name","blood"],["subject status","patients with acute sepsis"],["tissue","blood"],["genotype","WT"],["treatment","missing"],["time","Day 0"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR21048668","experiment_accession":"SRX17064060","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":25709763,"base_count":7712928900,"first_public":"2022-08-19","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: GSM6456152: SEP_5 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN30310197","study_accession":"PRJNA869559","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"SEP_4","description":"SEP_4","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM6456151","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-08-19","attributes":[["sour